      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Professor:",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " faça o papel do examinador, com tom neutro, sem corrigir durante a prova. Cronometre."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Part 1 (4–5 min)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Good afternoon. Can you tell me your full name? … Thank you. Now, let's talk about where you live.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Do you live in a house or an apartment? 2. What do you like about the area where you live? 3. Is there anything you would like to change about it?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let's talk about music.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " 4. What kind of music do you enjoy? 5. Did you learn to play a musical instrument as a child? 6. Do you prefer listening to music alone or with other people?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Now let's talk about mornings.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " 7. Are you a morning person? 8. What do you usually do in the morning before work or study?"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Part 2 (3–4 min)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Now I'm going to give you a topic, and I'd like you to talk about it for one to two minutes. Before you talk, you'll have one minute to think. You can make notes.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Describe a piece of advice you received that was very useful.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " You should say: who gave you the advice · what the advice was · when you received it · and explain why it was useful."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(1 min de preparação → até 2 min de fala)",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Follow-up:",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Do you often give advice to other people?",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Part 3 (4–5 min)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We've been talking about advice. Let's discuss this topic in more general terms.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Who do young people usually ask for advice in your country — parents, friends or the internet? Why?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Is advice from older people more valuable than advice from people of the same age?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Why do some people find it difficult to accept advice?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Do you think professional advisers, such as career coaches, are becoming more important? Why?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. How might the way people get advice change in the future?"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
